		},
		{
			"id": "todo",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 320,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 320,
			"text": "## Checklist\n- [ ] `Tab` to select a card\n- [ ] `Shift+arrows` to move it\n- [ ] `a` to add a linked card\n- [ ] `c` to connect two cards\n- [ ] `1`–`6` to colour a card\n- [ ] `Enter` to edit text\n- [ ] `u` to undo\n- [ ] `n` or double-click for a new card"
		},
		{
			"id": "mouse",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 420,
			"y": 320,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "## Mouse\nDrag cards to move them, drag the ◢ corner to resize, scroll to zoom, and drag empty space to pan."
		},
		{
			"id": "safe",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 420,
			"y": 520,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "> Open this board in Obsidian at the same time: edits from both apps are merged."
